; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 36px; font-family: georgia, serif;\"\u003e\u003cem style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: var(--tw-empty,/*!*/ /*!*/); --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: var(--tw-empty,/*!*/ /*!*/); --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: var(--tw-empty,/*!*/ /*!*/); --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eGreat People\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: var(--tw-empty,/*!*/ /*!*/); --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: lato, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" id\u003d\"isPasted\"\u003eThe quality of Bingemans\u0026#39; employees and the service they provide make Bingemans the leading hospitality provider and tourism attraction in the region. Our culture of guest service creates relationships and experiences that result not only in guest loyalty, but also in an exceptional work environment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: lato, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003eAt Bingemans we look for fun, professional and unique individuals to be a part of our team. Because we\u0026#39;re always looking for the best we offer the best!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: lato, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003eWhether guests are visiting Bingemans for a day of fun at \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.bigsplash.ca/\" style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 122, 183); text-decoration: none;\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBig Splash waterpark\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.funworx.ca/\" style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 122, 183); text-decoration: none;\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFunworX\u003c/a\u003e, a stay in our \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.bingemans.com/camping\" style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 122, 183); text-decoration: none;\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eCamping Resort\u003c/a\u003e or attending a \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.bingemans.com/conferences\" style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 122, 183); text-decoration: none;\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003emeeting, function or conference\u003c/a\u003e, our staff provide the utmost in client service and guest interactions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: lato, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003eBingemans provides on the job training, but at the same time, we insist employees have relevant education prior to starting. As a team member of Bingemans, you\u0026#39;ll receive a competitive wage, complimentary admission to our amusement facilities, discounts on park food, merchandise, fun activities and parties. It\u0026#39;s an opportunity to make new friends and lifelong memories. What are you waiting for? Find your place on our team!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: lato, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-a